<title>UK: Bank of America cuts 30 trading jobs in London.</title>
<headline>Bank of America cuts 30 trading jobs in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of America said it has cut 30 trading jobs from in its London-based global capital markets group.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the U.S. bank said the job losses were in foreign exchange, treasury, risk management and central strategic trtading -- the firm's propriety government security trading desk.</p>
<p>&quot;All changes were made in the gloabl capital markets group and reflect changing market conditions,&quot; the spokeswoman said, referring to falling volatility this year as one example.</p>
<p>--Mike Dolan, London newsroom +44 171 542 6762</p>
